Package: ganeti-os-nocloud
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, kpartx, uuid-runtime
Description: Ganeti OS definition for deploying cloud-init images
 This package provides a Ganeti OS definition for cloud-init images.  It
 injects user-data and meta-data directly into the root files system of the
 target OS, picked up by the NoCloud data source.
